# Google sign-in (frontend). Without it the access screen only offers the local profile.
# Create an OAuth 2.0 Web client at https://console.cloud.google.com/apis/credentials and add the
# origins you use under "Authorized JavaScript origins" (dev server: http://localhost:3000).
VITE_GOOGLE_CLIENT_ID=

# Server-side only (a future backend function). NEVER prefix it with VITE_: that would bundle it into the client.
# GEMINI_API_KEY=
